# Keep the build context small and avoid copying host build artifacts / secrets.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
frontend/dist/
whisper-service/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/App_Data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
.git/
.github/
mobile/
whisper-service/
**/.env
**/.env.*
.claude/
*.md
